  "title_en": "Intransitive and transitive verbs",
  "intro": "他动词带有直接作用的对象，对象通常用「を」；自动词描述主体的动作、变化或状态，不带这种直接宾语。下面把常用的自他动词成对比较，并列出读音、ます形和例句。",
  "intro_en": "Transitive verbs take a direct object, usually marked with を. Intransitive verbs describe an action, change, or state without a direct object. Compare these common pairs with readings, polite forms, and examples.",
